```Title: SID History Added to an Account (raw Windows Security events)```
```ATT&CK: T1134.005 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 03034695-d015-4424-80dc-8b7182ac783f```
```Data source: Windows Security EventCode 4765, 4766 (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows). Change index to where your Security logs live.```
```False positives: Domain migrations that use SID History (ADMT)```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=wineventlog source IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Security", "WinEventLog:Security")
(EventCode IN (4765, 4766))
| table _time host EventCode SubjectUserName SubjectDomainName TargetUserName TargetDomainName MemberName
